280	/**
281	 * Get scale min max and related info only depends on model settings.
282	 * This method can be called after coordinate system created.
283	 * For example, in data processing stage.
284	 *
285	 * Scale extent info probably be required multiple times during a workflow.
286	 * For example:
287	 * (1) `dataZoom` depends it to get the axis extent in "100%" state.
288	 * (2) `processor/extentCalculator` depends it to make sure whether axis extent is specified.
